# Olifant design system

Read `docs/Design.md` before building or changing UI. The original design-system export
lives in `design-system/` as a reference. Never import from it: its React components are
inline-styled prototypes. The app rebuilds them on shadcn/ui as described in Design.md §4.

## Non-negotiables

- **Colours:** only theme tokens (`bg-background`, `text-foreground`, `bg-primary`,
  `text-muted-foreground`, `border-border`, `bg-card`, `text-link`, `bg-success-subtle`, …)
  or the brand ramps that exist (`yellow-*`, `pine-*` except 400, `neutral-*`, and the
  defined `green`/`red`/`blue` steps). Never raw hex or rgb() in components, and never
  Tailwind's default palette (`gray`, `slate`, `zinc`, `amber`, `emerald`, …): it is
  disabled and renders nothing.
- **Yellow is the single hero accent.** At most one primary (yellow) button per view. No
  decorative yellow.
- **Type:** headings (`h1`–`h4`) are Wulkan Display via `font-heading`; everything else is
  Satoshi (`font-sans`). JetBrains Mono (`font-mono`) only for the timer clock, IDs,
  timestamps, and code. Use the design-system sizes: `text-heading-*`, `text-body-*`,
  `text-display-*`, `text-caption`, and the `eyebrow` utility.
- **Numbers** (durations, money, counts) use the `numeric` utility. Format with the helpers
  from Design.md §5.3: durations `8h 48m`, money `€1,240.00` / `$1,240.00`, currency always
  visible, EUR and USD never added together.
- **Shapes:** buttons, badges, and tags are pills (`rounded-full`); inputs and menu items
  `rounded-sm`; menus, popovers, and toasts `rounded-md`; cards, dialogs, and sheets
  `rounded-lg`.
- **Surfaces are flat.** White cards with a hairline border *or* a soft shadow, never both
  heavy. No gradients, textures, coloured left borders on cards, or emoji.
- **Icons:** `lucide-react` only, outline, 16–20px, stroke 2, `currentColor`. Icon-only
  buttons need an `aria-label` and a tooltip.
- **Task status** is always rendered with `<StatusBadge status=… />` (label + icon +
  colour, Design.md §5.1). Never colour alone.
- **Focus:** `focus-ring` on buttons, links, tabs, toggles, and clickable rows;
  `focus-field` on inputs, textareas, and select triggers. Never remove focus styles.
- **Motion:** 120–200ms with `ease-brand`. No bounce, no parallax, no looping animation.
  Skeletons are static `bg-muted` blocks, no shimmer.
- **Light theme only.** Do not add `dark:` classes, `next-themes`, or a theme toggle.
- **shadcn first.** Before hand-rolling a primitive, check the shadcn registry, then
  restyle it per Design.md §4.
- **Copy:** short and plain. Headings and labels in sentence case, buttons in Title Case,
  outline buttons and eyebrows uppercase via CSS. No emoji, no exclamation marks.
- **Freelancer screens never show other freelancers**: no names, avatars, counts, or
  totals that include other people's time (PRD §4).
